{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>Seed that is sown.</b> Sowing of kinds of seeds; זֵרוּעַ is a noun, as in ״וְיִתְּנוּ לָנוּ מִן הַזֵּרֹעִים״ (Daniel 1)." "<b>It is clean.</b> Scripture teaches you that it was not prepared and made fit to be called food to receive impurity until water comes upon it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:57.730947002Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}